| **Timing** | Arrive early (opening hour) at the zoo and aquarium to beat crowds. Late afternoon is perfect for the Tower Eye to catch sunset views. |
| **Food** | Most venues have family‑friendly cafés. For a budget‑friendly option, bring a picnic to the Royal Botanic Garden or Darling Harbour. |

